Subtract 3000 from both sides:

2N = 5400 - 3000 = 2400

Then, N = 2400 / 2 = 1200

So, the cost of one notebook is 1200 rubles. Let me check if this works with equation (1):

Original equation (1): 4P + 3N = 9600

